The separation between the marks appeared consistent with the wheel track of a passenger vehicle.
The tire mark documented by FHP investigators would have been consistent with location of the
passenger side tires of the [car manufacturer] at impact. The photographs also depicted debris from the [car manufacturer]
at the southwest corner of the intersection and trailing eastward from the area of impact. The
