brake light assembly, mounted at the top of the rear windshield, was displaced, but was still
hanging in its respective mounting location. The right side of the trunk lid was displaced forward.
The right side of the trunk lid was askew and lifted. The trunk was unable to be latched closed.
The right side of the plastic bumper covering sustained scratches.

